@startuml 38_Sequence_Concurrent_Payment_Submission
title Sequence - Two Concurrent Settlement Submissions (D24, NFR-009; CON-01 / CON-02)
autonumber
participant "Request T1\n(tab 1, token K1)" as T1
participant "Request T2\n(tab 2, token K2 or K1)" as T2
participant "PaymentService" as PS
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

note over T1, T2 : Plan: Bob -> Alice 48.33. Bob submits twice almost simultaneously.

T1 -> PS : recordSettlement(Bob, Alice, displayed 48.33, K1)
activate PS
PS -> DB : BEGIN; SELECT * FROM expense_groups WHERE id = g FOR UPDATE
DB --> PS : row lock granted to T1

T2 -> PS : recordSettlement(Bob, Alice, displayed 48.33, K2)
PS -> DB : BEGIN; SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
note right of DB : T2 BLOCKS (waits up to lock_timeout = 5 s)

PS -> DB : T1: idempotency K1 not found
PS -> DB : T1: read ledger postings -> plan -> obligation 48.33
PS -> DB : T1: INSERT payment(48.33, key K1); INSERT audit
PS -> DB : T1: COMMIT (releases lock)
PS --> T1 : RECORDED $48.33
deactivate PS

DB --> PS : row lock granted to T2
activate PS
alt T2 used same token K1 (double click)
  PS -> DB : T2: findByIdempotencyKey(K1) -> found
  PS -> DB : COMMIT
  PS --> T2 : ALREADY_RECORDED (shows T1 payment)
else T2 used different token K2 (second tab)
  PS -> DB : T2: read ledger postings (now includes T1 payment)
  PS -> PS : Bob net = 0.00 -> obligation(Bob, Alice) = 0.00
  PS -> DB : T2: INSERT audit PAYMENT_NOT_CREATED_ZERO_OBLIGATION; COMMIT
  PS --> T2 : ZERO_OBLIGATION (no payment)
else lock wait > 5 s
  DB --> PS : 55P03 lock_not_available
  PS -> PS : rollback; retry once with jitter
  PS --> T2 : outcome of retry or "System busy, retry"
end
deactivate PS
note over T1, T2 : Exactly one COMPLETED payment exists. Unique idempotency_key is the final backstop.
@enduml
